                        "sense_id": "51ba0658-a8ca-3705-ba01-1beaf7499471",
                        "entry_id": "48b9c906-2d16-3a56-ab9a-124e4b0159fa",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Without wrinkles."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a36bccb2-1df0-4f2c-9298-b90e5bdcb508",
                                "sense_id": "51ba0658-a8ca-3705-ba01-1beaf7499471",
                                "text": "an unwrinkled face"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72071c19-40ca-4a3a-89b1-cbc65a993447",
                                "sense_id": "51ba0658-a8ca-3705-ba01-1beaf7499471",
                                "text": "Where hee beheld the Sea’s unwrinkled face,\nSmile again on him with alluring Grace."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0b0cd5a0-f19a-47de-8ebb-ad7ebf54a311",
                                "sense_id": "51ba0658-a8ca-3705-ba01-1beaf7499471",
                                "text": "Where pity, to the mind conveyed\nIn pleasure, is the darkest shade\nThat Time, unwrinkled grandsire, flings\nFrom his smoothly gliding wings."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9748dea4-4451-4bb9-9ea3-0230cbecac24",
                                "sense_id": "51ba0658-a8ca-3705-ba01-1beaf7499471",
                                "text": "His fair hair waved long and freely over a white and unwrinkled forehead: the life of a camp and the suns of Italy had but little embrowned his clear and healthful complexion, which retained much of the bloom of youth."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dea1be85-4096-4f9c-8d74-1362d7569940",
                                "sense_id": "51ba0658-a8ca-3705-ba01-1beaf7499471",
                                "text": "Muley’s face was smooth and unwrinkled, but it wore the truculent look of a bad child’s, the mouth held tight and small, the little eyes half scowling, half petulant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6bb20f32-64ac-425c-99c0-e18a51df3a57",
                                "sense_id": "51ba0658-a8ca-3705-ba01-1beaf7499471",
                                "text": "The lieutenant of the watch, his telescope quite dazzling with polished brass and pipe-clayed twine, wore spotless and unwrinkled white trousers; the buttons on his well-fitting coat winked in the sunshine."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
